*.o
*.elf
*.map
*.d
**/nbproject/private
**/nbproject/Makefile-*
**/nbproject/Package-*
**/nbproject/project.properties
**/*.X/debug
**/*.X/dist
**/*.X/build
**/*.X/.generated_files
**/*.IAR/Debug
**/*.IAR/settings
**/*.IAR/*.dep
**/*.IAR/*.custom_argvars

# Per-machine tool config (written by setup_compiler.py) - never commit
setup_compiler.config

# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# MCC backup artifacts (written when migrating .mc3 -> the v5.6 YAML model)
*.mc3.bak0
*.bak0

# Board-to-project assignment written by setup_flasher.py - probe serial numbers
# are specific to the boards on one desk, so this is per-machine, not per-repo.
boards.json

# Follower build output. The bridge tracks release/*.hex for historical reasons
# (see CLAUDE.md section 2); the follower does not repeat that.
follower/release/
